OL,3,GNEWSA'No justification for 55 job
OL,4,Alosses' at packaging company, says
OL,5,Aunion
OL,6,
OL,7,FA union has said that there is "no
OL,8,Fjustification" for what it has said
OL,9,Fwill be 55 job losses at the Lurgan
OL,10,Fsite of a packaging company.
OL,12,FSmurfit Westrock, which also have a
OL,13,Fsite in Dublin, said they have begun a
OL,14,Fconsultation process to restructure its
OL,15,FLurgan plant in Northern Ireland.
OL,17,FThe company said the restructuring is
OL,18,Fpart of "a planned investment programme
OL,19,Fover the next 18 months" that will"
OL,20,Fstrengthen and modernise operations".
